<text><body><div type="page" n="93"><pb n="93" facs="#f0105"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">1. Statistik.</fw>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p93-b1" facs="#f0105-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0105-l1"/>2) Die Familiendichtigkeit. Auf 1 Familie kommen Seelen in:</ab>
<table xml:id="p93-b2" facs="#f0105-b2" rows="14" cols="7"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Jahre.</cell><cell role="label">den Landesbezirken <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label">den Landesbezirken <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label">den Landesbezirken <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lob.-Ebersd.</placeName></cell><cell role="label">dem Fürstenthum männl.</cell><cell role="label">dem Fürstenthum weibl.</cell><cell role="label">dem Fürstenthum überhaupt.</cell></row><row><cell>1647</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>4,50</cell></row><row><cell>1834</cell><cell>4,59</cell><cell>4,75</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>1837</cell><cell>4,70</cell><cell>4,79</cell><cell>4,71</cell><cell>2,33</cell><cell>2,40</cell><cell>4,73</cell></row><row><cell>1840</cell><cell>4,71</cell><cell>4,67</cell><cell>5,05</cell><cell>2,39</cell><cell>2,47</cell><cell>4,86</cell></row><row><cell>1843</cell><cell>4,67</cell><cell>4,55</cell><cell>4,84</cell><cell>2,29</cell><cell>2,38</cell><cell>4,67</cell></row><row><cell>1846</cell><cell>4,81</cell><cell>4,85</cell><cell>5,16</cell><cell>2,43</cell><cell>2,49</cell><cell>4,92</cell></row><row><cell>1849</cell><cell>4,68</cell><cell>4,87</cell><cell>4,67</cell><cell>2,32</cell><cell>2,41</cell><cell>4,73</cell></row><row><cell>1852</cell><cell>4,70</cell><cell>4,53</cell><cell>4,81</cell><cell>2,29</cell><cell>2,38</cell><cell>4,67</cell></row><row><cell>1855</cell><cell>4,53</cell><cell>4,69</cell><cell>4,80</cell><cell>2,28</cell><cell>2,37</cell><cell>4,66</cell></row><row><cell>1858</cell><cell>4,67</cell><cell>4,54</cell><cell>4,61</cell><cell>2,27</cell><cell>2,34</cell><cell>4,62</cell></row><row><cell>1861</cell><cell>4,68</cell><cell>4,62</cell><cell>4,71</cell><cell>2,29</cell><cell>2,38</cell><cell>4,67</cell></row><row><cell>1864</cell><cell>4,40</cell><cell>4,49</cell><cell>4,46</cell><cell>2,18</cell><cell>2,27</cell><cell>4,45</cell></row><row><cell>1867</cell><cell>4,72</cell><cell>4,51</cell><cell>4,66</cell><cell>2,28</cell><cell>2,37</cell><cell>4,64</cell></row></table>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p93-b3" facs="#f0105-b3"><lb n="4" facs="#f0105-l4"/>3) Die Bevölkerungsdichtigkeit. Auf 1 ☐Meile kommen:</ab>
<table xml:id="p93-b4" facs="#f0105-b4" rows="6" cols="9"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Jahre.</cell><cell role="label">Bez. <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>. Familien.</cell><cell role="label">Bez. <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>. Einw.</cell><cell role="label">Bez. <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>. Familien.</cell><cell role="label">Bez. <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>. Einw.</cell><cell role="label">Bez. <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lob.-Ebersd.</placeName> Familien.</cell><cell role="label">Bez. <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lob.-Ebersd.</placeName> Einw.</cell><cell role="label">Fürstenthum. Familien.</cell><cell role="label">Fürstenthum. Einw.</cell></row><row><cell>1834</cell><cell>1479,40</cell><cell>6788,83</cell><cell>769,15</cell><cell>3652,73</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>3989,60</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>4603,78</cell></row><row><cell>1843</cell><cell>1548,63</cell><cell>7242,92</cell><cell>881,03</cell><cell>4004,14</cell><cell>889,60</cell><cell>4309,80</cell><cell>1062,15</cell><cell>4972,31</cell></row><row><cell>1852</cell><cell>1707,19</cell><cell>8034,24</cell><cell>916,47</cell><cell>4324,07</cell><cell>934,40</cell><cell>4474,40</cell><cell>1134,06</cell><cell>5300,39</cell></row><row><cell>1861</cell><cell>1836,27</cell><cell>8603,47</cell><cell>945,45</cell><cell>4370,98</cell><cell>948,00</cell><cell>4466,20</cell><cell>1184,66</cell><cell>5535,19</cell></row><row><cell>1867</cell><cell>1984,11</cell><cell>9491,81</cell><cell>1005,97</cell><cell>4538,64</cell><cell>958,40</cell><cell>4470,80</cell><cell>1251,91</cell><cell>5853,22</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p93-b5"><lb n="16" facs="#f0105-l16"/>Die dichteste Bevölkerung gehört somit dem Bezirke <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName> mit 9491,81 <lb n="17" facs="#f0105-l17"/>Seelen auf die ☐Meile, die dünnste dem Bezirke <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName> mit <lb n="18" facs="#f0105-l18"/>4470,80 Seelen auf die ☐Meile. Uebrigens ist die gegenwärtige Bevölkerungs<lb n="19" break="no" facs="#f0105-l19"/>dichtigkeit des Landes eine vergleichungsweise sehr starke, zumal wenn man <lb n="20" facs="#f0105-l20"/>das diesseitige bedeutende <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-wald">Waldareal</rs> in Anschlag bringt. Am deutlichsten zeigt <lb n="21" facs="#f0105-l21"/>dies eine Vergleichung der Volksdichtigkeit des Fürstenthums mit der Volks<lb n="22" break="no" facs="#f0105-l22"/>dichtigkeit in anderen Ländern:</p>
</div></body></text>
